fs-melee-whirl-spent = Too hurt to keep spinning.
fs-melee-hint-knife = Right click stabs in a quick flurry. Crits zombies that are half dead, and executes staggered ones that are nearly dead.
fs-melee-hint-bat = Hold right click to wind up, then let go to send zombies flying. The longer the wind-up, the harder the hit. Crits when a launched zombie crashes into another.
fs-melee-hint-fireaxe = Hold right click to charge an overhead slam that staggers everything around where it lands. A full charge always crits and sets staggered zombies on fire.
fs-melee-hint-halberd = Thrusts go through a whole line of zombies. Hold it in both hands and right click to spin all the way round. Crits zombies that are knocked down.
fs-melee-hint-cutlass = Right click draws the flintlock in your pack and fires it. Shots recharge on their own, and the weapon panel shows how many are ready.
fs-melee-hint-chainsaw = Every hit in a row builds rev, shown in the weapon panel, and each point of rev makes the saw hit harder. Right click dumps all of it into one big rip through the crowd. At full rev the saw crits. Stop sawing for a moment and the rev starts over.
fs-melee-hint-esword = Turn it on, then right click to dash through the zombie nearest your cursor, cutting everything in the way. Chain dashes for more damage; the last one in a chain crits.
